      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "efacbdf9bbc58cd6",
      "translationZh": "PwC 正在部署 Claude 以构建技术、执行交易并为客户重塑企业职能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e111987c421e7dc",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 和 PwC 今日宣布扩大其战略联盟，深化 PwC 使用 Claude 构建技术、执行交易并为客户重塑企业职能的方式，覆盖其服务的每个行业。大多数企业仍在运行为预 AI 世界构建的系统和流程——这一拖累估计超过 2 trillion。Anthropic 和 PwC 正在帮助公司摆脱这一负担，围绕 AI 进行重建。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb0a01e52dfdaa63",
      "translationZh": "公告的关键要素：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c9f3385a5483f2ff",
      "translationZh": "PwC 将从 U.S. 团队开始推出 Claude Code 和 Cowork，随后扩展至覆盖数十万专业人士的全球劳动力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e615258657b87d9",
      "translationZh": "公司正在建立一个联合卓越中心以及一个培训和认证 30,000 名 PwC 专业人员使用 Claude 的项目。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "00596cceb2874ef8",
      "translationZh": "合作聚焦于三个最高杠杆领域：agentic technology build、AI-native deal-making 和企业职能的重塑。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "52c82ec2a23fb9a5",
      "translationZh": "PwC 正在推出一个新的财务业务群组（Office of the CFO），以 Claude 为基础构建，作为首个独立业务单元，锚定在 Anthropic 的技术上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ef35723a45a0ef6",
      "translationZh": "Claude 已在专业体育运营、保险承保、大型机现代化、HR 转型和网络安全等生产环境中运行，使交付时间缩短多达 70%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
